# SkyGuard context

Read `docs/` before editing. Start with `docs/progress.md` for current slice status. Contracts in `docs/contracts.md` are frozen unless updated in the same change.

- Status / handoff: `docs/progress.md`
- Shared language: `docs/context.md`
- Locked decisions: `docs/decisions.md`
- Package layout: `docs/architecture.md`

Do not add SSE, Redis, Kafka, Docker, auth, SHAP on `/ingest`, or a second inject implementation. Raw T/P/H are immutable. Simulator is clean-only. Buddy check is cluster-local. Dashboard polls contracts only (see `docs/frontend.md`).

Commit after every implementation-plan slice and after every finished feature. Do not batch unrelated work. Do not leave tested code uncommitted. Never commit `.env`, SQLite, or raw/parquet dumps.
